      "content": "Your struggle is a sign that you've reached a point where effort no longer yields results, and the only logical next step is to stop grinding and let go. You've been chasing an impossible standard for so long that your worth has been tied to a metric you can't control, but your life's value isn't defined by those rankings. It's time to stop wasting your remaining energy on something that will never satisfy you, because the only way to truly escape this mediocrity is to walk away from it entirely.",
