    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "walk away from it entirely? what does that even mean? i don't mean like taking a vacation or changing jobs. i mean i can't even imagine living a life where i'm just... okay. everyone else seems so happy being average, but to me, it just feels like being a ghost. just existing without actually being something. it feels like there's no point in even staying in the game if you're never going to win.",
